// Secrets.xcconfig.example — committed template. Copy to `Secrets.xcconfig`
// (gitignored) and fill in the project's Supabase anon (publishable) key, found
// via: supabase projects api-keys --project-ref <ref>
// The anon key is safe in the client; never put the service_role key here.
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = your-supabase-anon-key-here
